# Workspace packages are linked only through the explicit "workspace:*"
# protocol (pnpm 9+ default). After moving directories around, do a clean
# reinstall (rm -rf node_modules && pnpm install): pnpm does not refresh the
# private hoist of type packages inside its virtual store on its own.

# Mobile app note: if Metro/Expo cannot resolve workspace packages with the
# isolated node_modules layout, uncomment the line below and run
# `pnpm install` again.
# node-linker=hoisted
